    {
      "sequence_id": 1,
      "text": "3. How to indicate acknowledgement\n\nIn English, you can sometimes say 'Is that right?' or the like to acknowledge that you have heard what another said without necessarily agreeing. Look at the following:\n\nAa, soo desu ka?    Oh, is that so? / I see / Good\n\nThe expression looks like a question but is really an acknowledgement. It is used when you want to indicate that you've understood what was said."
    }
